Column name: carbon_offset_metric_tons Type: FLOAT64 Description: The potential carbon dioxide abatement of the solar capacity that meets the technical potential criteria. The calculation uses eGRID subregion CO2 equivalent non-baseload output emission rates. https://www.epa.gov/sites/production/files/2015-10/documents/egrid2012_summarytables_0.pdf
Column name: existing_installs_count Type: INT64 Description: # of buildings estimated to have a solar installation, at time of data collection
Column name: center_point Type: GEOGRAPHY
